shortdesc LaTeX package for multiple-choice questions
longdesc This package adjusts the choices of the multiple-choice
longdesc question automatically. It has been wholly inspired by the work
longdesc of Enrico Gregorio and improved by Vafa Khalighi and I've just
longdesc packed and redistributed it under the name of the
longdesc multiple-choice package.
